Key Takeaway

Azure App Service Plans provide the compute resources that power Azure Web Apps and APIs. By selecting the correct pricing tier, implementing vertical and horizontal scaling, and configuring autoscale policies, Azure Administrators can build highly available, cost-effective, and scalable web application environments. Understanding pricing tiers, Scale Up versus Scale Out, and Autoscale configuration is essential for both the AZ-104 exam and real-world Azure administration.
